{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_28477543ca06e8381941057e161dc27365868ec2e470d09ddbd2cbc6c7dca687","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6fc309e66ae6443f05d3639eea12e3a881ae2859ce788e8a9378ad533b84b14d"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"Malformed configuration fails loudly at command load time, listing every problem (empty branch names, negative port, identical integration and production branches) rather than failing later.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2c5447b7d4a3e98ce7f3a6aa9204b70692432ad4db6f735acf6e9f83daa08132","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d43960f994cfe8b764a46849516c3783e0cecf1a4183c91e9eba618b214b08aa"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"A pre-push hook rejects direct git pushes to the integration branch and runs checkCommand before allowing a landing; with no checkCommand configured, every push fails by default.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3570e6f71bd9beea564a6a38c32ea12780b5d02d3657cd2e4ad253528b637b26","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fa86ac5591f52e22e275ffbf65e968810276a9a59b9eb3f074fd8d894a2d12aa"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"Locks are crash-safe via PID liveness rather than timeouts, and a slow checkCommand caps throughput since the FIFO lock is held for its entire duration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_42f2d40aa060954133b2e3a998c95b76bbdce66389ca7c174fe7a3fd5c269496","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f2bdf044b71efdad9883aa047fc45f9efe3f9d7d08331f66b9ecce315f38401f","slc_f9816b819eec870b711c6c88995c66185b3248576f2a34aa47290b42620fddc3"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"Configuration lives in a single .mjs file with fields for branchPrefix, worktreeSuffix, portBase, integration/production branches, protectedBranches, regenerableFiles, symlinks, buildOutputDirs, checkCommand, and checksRequired.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_62b445cae0724ccc6faf14d5ae3d3c2e55c19b7814a2d0128a95f2eb25523b2a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5e6807aa732076b11cd5a28019c0db740202eb62dfb9fef90219de1652e6f2b0"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"README badges indicate TypeScript 5.x, Node >=18, MIT license, and zero runtime dependencies; the package is published on npm as claude-code-merge-queue.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6f657d7ee898b7731a68c0198890d613ca0c504c9b7f9dd5dea2be7c5ee40f24","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fa86ac5591f52e22e275ffbf65e968810276a9a59b9eb3f074fd8d894a2d12aa"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"The queue is single-machine: the FIFO lock lives in local temp storage, so concurrent landings from two machines only get git's ordinary non-fast-forward rejection.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8299b266e0a3b8e291f6c1407e0593361a9d20231bb3a408f730ac0c3d2818fa","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5e98eafd5ebb2e9d5a276b5668224807545c7e0261fc6a0b96f30dece8f13702","slc_9bd3a17c5432e525e27c6493f54c6e1077520dae106871b648d50e9f15420282"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"An init command writes a config file, CLAUDE.md instructions, a .claude/settings.json hook wiring, Husky pre-push hook if present, and package.json scripts like land, sync, promote, preview.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8d67d2cf16386f40107a22d686416c754a008965e48b8fda88689273b9406e20","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ea6af056145f0136cf29cb4235c714dd884e8fa3609277ad92af58ad5e248041"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"The CLI exposes commands including hook worktree-create, build-lock, land, sync, promote, preview, port, and prune, each documented with its purpose.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a0e10b4bc82e4c5175ff39eb3517c93b07f8522741993a31ef5d8eaf0c99e35b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ea6af056145f0136cf29cb4235c714dd884e8fa3609277ad92af58ad5e248041"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"A WorktreeCreate hook plugs the tool's numbered lanes into Claude Code's native worktree creation, and build-lock serializes builds machine-wide across lanes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_edd6b3f90e66cb6c5fa9c17134462523f5cb276206ecf7c83712140f24a87903","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1e4659daa9e1784fd3752365afad852eb2469fbd6edc3a0372982b237c4d93a7","slc_b779047b607b743408ea75cd5f0ba68c275b5b03caf040c3eafa9f995eddb937","slc_eb3f59084ad0d61cd10da7e6998787bd1e7a1ea1e2f942974632a443a8943687"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"Blocked pushes can be bypassed via a single environment variable (CLAUDE_CODE_MERGE_QUEUE_EMERGENCY_PUSH=1), which the README notes is a convention, not a guarantee against an adversarial agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_eede019b57cccd75d2bc8473b64439d724ba912b6367947fdb9dd131c21374bf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fa86ac5591f52e22e275ffbf65e968810276a9a59b9eb3f074fd8d894a2d12aa"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"No human review occurs before landing; checkCommand passing is the only gate, and the tool cannot distinguish a real test suite from a trivially passing command.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","created_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f2cf10b8af9e939498d56fef386700b3262b8296964bbd4623851d0cfc138052","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"funador/claude-code-merge-queue@f77757479cab snapshot 52448af2613d1623","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ea6af056145f0136cf29cb4235c714dd884e8fa3609277ad92af58ad5e248041"],"source_ids":["src_4da4077fefe657f8a56b600441983fef"],"text":"The land command rebases and pushes a lane onto the integration branch through a FIFO queue so two lanes are never mid-push simultaneously; agents can run it themselves.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:51:30Z","updated_by_operation":"op_3c7c03ab69fb46bfa223785e77333412"}
